Convert this Python while loop (FizzBuzz) to JavaScript:

i = 1
while i <= 15:
    if i % 15 == 0:
        print("FizzBuzz")
    elif i % 3 == 0:
        print("Fizz")
    elif i % 5 == 0:
        print("Buzz")
    else:
        print(i)
    i += 1

output:
```js
for (let i = 1; i <= 15; i++) {
  if (i % 15 === 0) console.log("FizzBuzz");
  else if (i % 3 === 0) console.log("Fizz");
  else if (i % 5 === 0) console.log("Buzz");
  else console.log(i);
}
```

